#### Stage 3: Distribution Matching Distillation.

Finally, we initialize from the Stage-2 checkpoint at iteration 2500 and fine-tune with distribution matching distillation on the same 4-step schedule. The real score is provided by the frozen teacher and the fake score is learned online. We use five critic updates per generator update, EMA weight 0.99 starting from step 1, generator learning rate 2×10−62\times 10^{-6}, critic learning rate 4×10−74\times 10^{-7}, guidance scale 3.0, and timestep shift 5.0. The total batch size is 16, obtained with per-GPU batch size 8 on 8 GPUs and gradient accumulation of 2.

